abels/estimates/null hours/M0 remain unchanged.\n\nRetain all integration/final attempts and the first recursive-record test fixture compile failure (copy-constructor conflict), corrected without weakening runtime checks. Raw schemas/source/logs exclude credentials/private fixtures, artifacts and clone objects; observed source hashes are not immutable full-build attestation and trusted-parent/race limits remain.\n\n- [Decision ADR0014](https://github.com/Cephalon-Labs/Cehpalon-Engine-Docs/blob/main/internal/adr/ADR-0014-small-api-contract-export.md)\n- [Predeclared correctness protocol](https://github.com/Cephalon-Labs/Cehpalon-Engine-Docs/blob/main/internal/validation/tooling-contract-export-protocol.md)\n- [Delivery report](https://github.com/Cephalon-Labs/Cehpalon-Engine-Docs/blob/main/internal/planning/tooling-contract-export.md)\n- [Exact-source results](https://github.com/Cephalon-Labs/Cehpalon-Engine-Docs/blob/main/internal/evidence/tooling-contracts/delivery.json)\n- [Actual artifact/runtime differential proof](https://github.com/Cephalon-Labs/Cehpalon-Engine-Samples/tree/main/tooling-contracts)\n\n\n## Tooling observations - 2026-10-30\nUser continued existing #20 after offline contract export. Before: source-only CLI/scaffold/export correctness, no fixed current tooling measurement matrix. After: actual Roslyn DriverRun+PEEmit versus independently authored equivalent typed registry PEEmit, plus real CLI new/validate/four selected offline export fresh processes. Runtime libraries/templates unchanged; Core/Composition/codegen and actual emitted consumers are exercised. Full acceptance remains open; W5/#2/#11 dependencies, In Progress/P2/M0, full Test/Benchmark Planned, Type/labels/estimates and null hours unchanged. #3 body/editable metadata stays identical and Blocked.\n\n- [x] Predeclared sizes1/3/32 x fresh/no-op/edit, independent registration AST and lazy-factory/dispatch/disposal parity, exact two paired primers then five paired repetitions of three. Pa