rices were repeated without weakening checks. All raw attempts/agent worktrees remain.\n\nBenchmark applicability: Not required for this bounded file-generation/consumer-correctness slice; no runtime timing or throughput claim. Full tooling/generator-speed/transport-generation benchmark remains Planned. No Small API benchmark was repeated or substituted. Source hashes are observations, not immutable attestations; trusted filesystem/build parents and inherited SDK/MSBuild policy remain required. No package/global-tool, AOT/trimming, HTTP/GraphQL/Worker/provider profile or production acceptance is claimed.\n\nNew hosted Windows2025 SDK/package/localhost evidence is real execution, distinct from prior payment-rejected runs. Per the user, #3 remains Blocked with body/editable metadata unchanged; review its full qualification checklist separately before any promotion. No billing/forced unchanged rerun/publication/dependency/estimate/maturity change.\n\n- [Decision ADR0012](https://github.com/Cephalon-Labs/Cehpalon-Engine-Docs/blob/main/internal/adr/ADR-0012-portable-cli-scaffolding.md)\n- [Predeclared bounded protocol](https://github.com/Cephalon-Labs/Cehpalon-Engine-Docs/blob/main/internal/validation/portable-cli-scaffolding-protocol.md)\n- [Delivery report](https://github.com/Cephalon-Labs/Cehpalon-Engine-Docs/blob/main/internal/planning/portable-cli-scaffolding.md)\n- [Exact-source results and raw retention](https://github.com/Cephalon-Labs/Cehpalon-Engine-Docs/blob/main/internal/evidence/tooling/delivery.json)\n- [Actual generated consumer proof](https://github.com/Cephalon-Labs/Cehpalon-Engine-Samples/tree/main/tooling)\n\n\n## Small API scaffold profile — 2026-10-29\nUser authorized an actual Small API CLI/scaffolding profile using existing Core/Composition/code generation, with cross-tenant and disabled-module tests, while #3 remains Blocked. Before: CLI generated only the portable console profile. After: `new --profile small-api` and profile-aware pure `validate`